    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides information about the result of a visit. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>After walking all the users (recursively) of a pointer, the basic infrastructure records some commonly useful information such as escape analysis and whether the visit completed or aborted early. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
